WEBVTT

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:30.393
(Laughter)

00:00:30.417 --> 00:00:33.018
But for everybody else,
I really hope you'll believe me

00:00:33.042 --> 00:00:35.684
when I tell you no police chief
likes talking to me

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:37.934
because they think
I'm a clinical psychologist.

00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:39.226
And also I'm not.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:42.101
I have no idea what your mother
did to you, and I can't help.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:43.143
(Laughter)

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:45.184
Police chiefs like talking to me

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:49.809
because I'm an expert on a problem
that feels impossible for them to solve:

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:51.768
racism in their profession.

00:00:51.792 --> 00:00:54.268
Now my expertise
comes from being a scientist

00:00:54.292 --> 00:00:58.101
who studies how our minds learn
to associate Blackness and crime

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:01.893
and misperceive Black children
as older than they actually are.